---
// FeaturesGrid.astro
---
<section class="section" id="keunggulan">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Kenapa Memilih Kami?</h2>
      <p>Pengerjaan rapi, aman, dan selalu sesuai dengan standar teknis lapangan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-primary)"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Perlindungan Lahan Sekitar</h3>
        <p>Metode pengeboran kami diatur agar tidak menimbulkan pergeseran tanah lateral. Rumah atau tembok tetangga dijamin aman dari risiko retak struktur.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-primary)"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5C6 11.1 5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sistem Sirkulasi Bentonite</h3>
        <p>Khusus pada lapisan tanah berpasir atau berair, kami menggunakan cairan bentonite untuk melapisi dinding lubang bor agar tidak mudah longsor sebelum dicor.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-primary)"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/><path d="M8 18h.01"/><path d="M16 18h.01"/><path d="M12 14h.01"/><path d="M8 14h.01"/><path d="M16 14h.01"/><path d="M12 10h.01"/><path d="M8 10h.01"/><path d="M16 10h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Transparansi Harga Total</h3>
        <p>Mulai dari harga per meter lari, biaya mobilisasi alat, hingga minimum charge (lumpsum) dijelaskan tertulis di awal. Tidak ada biaya siluman di tengah proyek.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-primary)"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/><path d="M10 9H8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Laporan Kerja Harian</h3>
        <p>Klien menerima update harian mencakup log kedalaman bor tiap titik, formasi tanah yang ditembus, dan volume pengecoran beton aktual di lapangan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

